{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17382","headline":"韦宾客宅与诸博士宴集 · 权德舆","name":"韦宾客宅与诸博士宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"累抗乞身章，湛恩比上庠。\n宾筵徴稷嗣，家法自扶阳。\n簪组欢言久，琴壶雅兴长。\n阴岚冒苔石，轻籁韵风篁。\n佩玉三朝贵，挥金百虑忘。\n因知卧商洛，岂胜白云乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}